# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# This repository is edited by hand, mostly as JSON, by contributors on
# whatever machine they have. core.autocrlf=true is the Windows default, and
# without this a contributor there returns a pull request whose diff is every
# line of the file rather than the line they changed, which is unreviewable and
# unmergeable for a reason nobody can see by reading it.
#
# Everything in the index is already LF, so this changes no file today. It only
# holds that true once strangers start sending changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The illustrations and syllabus sheets. Never mangled, never diffed as text.
*.webp binary
